commit 5360dc63d5c6ffe1da8222d63c426955176b2f1b

C03: wanting to work in a known absent program is answered by its absence (APPS1671)

«quiero editar una foto en photoshop» names the program the person wants to work in; Photoshop is not in this PC's Start catalog and the request went to the model with no reading. The use-to-do frame («quiero/necesito/tengo que editar, retocar, usar, trabajar … en/con <known software>», and its English forms) now binds the name for the app.installed presence read when the verified catalog does not hold it; a catalog application keeps being an opening request for the other readers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


